result
result-*
.direnv

# NOTE: hosts/*/hardware-configuration.nix and hosts/*/ssh-keys.local.nix were
# gitignored here, inherited from ac-host's convention. That was wrong for THIS
# repo and gate 1 proved it: building from github:imkarrer/homelab does not
# include gitignored files, so the fetched source had no hardware description
# and no keys. diff-closures showed all three authorized_keys derivations
# disappearing and the initrd shrinking by 14.7 MiB as it fell back to the
# hardware stub that "will not boot a real machine".
#
# A repo whose entire purpose is holding host facts must not ignore the host's
# facts. hosts/<name>/ is where machine-specific files belong, and neither file
# is a secret: SSH public keys are public by definition, and disk UUIDs appear
# in countless public NixOS configurations. Both are now tracked.

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/

# Cutover surface captures — ephemeral working state, regenerated per attempt.
.cutover/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Navigation links into the sibling trees. Machine-local by design: they point
# outside the repo, so a clone elsewhere would only get broken links.
# scripts/hub-links.sh regenerates them from hub/repos.psv.
hub/trees/
